# Funciona com a extensão REST Client do VS Code.
# No servidor (atrás do Nginx/CloudFront) use @base = http://IP_OU_DOMINIO/api
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Cadastrar usuário (retorna o token)
POST {{base}}/users/persist
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana", "email": "ana@teste.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login (copie o token da resposta para @token)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@teste.com", "password": "123456" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Meus dados
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar meu usuário
POST {{base}}/users/persist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Maria" }

### Listar tarefas
GET {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar só as concluídas
GET {{base}}/tasks?done=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar tarefa
POST {{base}}/tasks/persist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Minha primeira tarefa" }

### Criar tarefa inválida (espera erro)
POST {{base}}/tasks/persist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### Buscar por id
GET {{base}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Concluir tarefa (grava done_at com a hora atual)
POST {{base}}/tasks/persist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }

### Remover tarefa
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
